Third-party components
----------------------

This kit vendors one built artefact of third-party code, pinned by content address in `osyrin.lock`:
`xyflow-system.js` (chunk XY). It is NOT covered by the licence above; it bundles the packages below, each under its
own terms, reproduced here. (`layered-layout.js`, chunk Layout, is built from the kit's own `layout.ts` and is covered
by the licence above.)

